WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:06.242
Things in Prickly Pear sure weren't peaceful now!

2
00:00:06.243 --> 00:00:11.419
The sheriff and deputy ducked as tomatoes flew.

3
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:17.650
Finally those pesky raccoons took off.

4
00:00:17.651 --> 00:00:22.933
Roscoe ran after them. "Stop or I'll shoot!"

5
00:00:22.934 --> 00:00:25.551
He reached for his slingshot.

6
00:00:25.552 --> 00:00:30.151
But he slipped on a squashed tomato and fell.

7
00:00:30.152 --> 00:00:34.188
Cleo tumbled on top of him.

8
00:00:34.189 --> 00:00:39.133
Cleo groaned. "They got away!"

9
00:00:39.134 --> 00:00:41.635
Sam came outside.

10
00:00:41.636 --> 00:00:44.772
"The Tomato Brothers are nothing but trouble."

11
00:00:44.773 --> 00:00:50.544
Roscoe jumped up. "We'll stop them!"

12
00:00:50.545 --> 00:00:55.947
He and Cleo raced down Main Street, looking for the raccoons.

13
00:00:55.948 --> 00:01:01.796
Just then they heard a scream. "Stop! You can't do that!"

14
00:01:01.797 --> 00:01:03.466
Roscoe gulped.

15
00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:06.192
It was Miss Annie!

16
00:01:06.193 --> 00:01:09.915
He and Cleo ran to the schoolhouse.

17
00:01:09.916 --> 00:01:13.048
They saw a terrible sight.

18
00:01:13.049 --> 00:01:17.916
Raw eggs dripped down the front of the schoolhouse.

19
00:01:17.917 --> 00:01:21.151
Broken shells lay everywhere.

20
00:01:21.152 --> 00:01:26.374
The raccoons laughed and then ran down an alley.

21
00:01:26.375 --> 00:01:29.262
Cleo raced after them.

22
00:01:29.263 --> 00:01:32.026
"Don't worry, Miss Annie," Roscoe said.

23
00:01:32.027 --> 00:01:34.359
"We'll catch those troublemakers.

24
00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.117
Oswald, grab a bucket of water.

25
00:01:36.118 --> 00:01:37.977
Help Miss Annie clean up."

26
00:01:37.978 --> 00:01:40.305
Roscoe ran after Cleo.

27
00:01:40.306 --> 00:01:44.859
He found her wiping egg off her face.

28
00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:47.299
"What happened?" he asked.

29
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:53.398
Cleo frowned. "They threw eggs at me and got away again."

30
00:01:53.399 --> 00:01:57.033
Fritzy ran over, waving his paws.

31
00:01:57.034 --> 00:02:00.786
"The Tomato Brothers are in the saloon!"

32
00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:04.106
Roscoe grabbed his slingshot and handcuffs.

33
00:02:04.107 --> 00:02:10.419
"Time to arrest these pests. Let's go, Deputy."

34
00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:13.443
They went to the saloon.

35
00:02:13.444 --> 00:02:16.528
The raccoons were already gone.

36
00:02:16.529 --> 00:02:20.590
But they'd left behind a whole lot of trouble.

37
00:02:20.591 --> 00:02:24.568
The customers had red faces and watery eyes.

38
00:02:24.569 --> 00:02:29.234
A few were spitting their juice onto the floor.

39
00:02:29.235 --> 00:02:33.076
Roscoe ran to the owner. "What's going on, Buster?"

40
00:02:33.077 --> 00:02:35.928
"The Tomato Brothers came in and sat down."

41
00:02:35.929 --> 00:02:39.830
Buster pointed to a big glass container.

42
00:02:39.831 --> 00:02:44.916
"When I wasn't looking, they poured hot sauce into the juice!"

43
00:02:44.917 --> 00:02:47.413
"Don't worry," Roscoe said.

44
00:02:47.414 --> 00:02:49.438
"We'll lock them up."

45
00:02:49.439 --> 00:02:52.473
He and Cleo went back outside.

46
00:02:52.474 --> 00:02:55.830
There was no sign of the raccoons.

47
00:02:55.831 --> 00:03:00.116
Roscoe saw Mayor Wayne running toward them.

48
00:03:00.117 --> 00:03:03.373
"Sheriff! Deputy! What do you know about this?"

49
00:03:03.374 --> 00:03:07.377
Mayor Wayne had a sheet of paper in his paws.

50
00:03:07.378 --> 00:03:11.068
"The Tomato Brothers put these flyers up all over town."

51
00:03:11.069 --> 00:03:14.081
Roscoe took the sheet.

52
00:03:14.082 --> 00:03:16.882
Cleo read over his shoulder.

53
00:03:16.883 --> 00:03:20.050
Here's what that flyer said:

54
00:03:20.051 --> 00:03:22.650
We are the Tomato Brothers.

55
00:03:22.651 --> 00:03:27.179
We challenge the sheriff and his deputy to a food fight.

56
00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:30.067
When: Thursday at noon

57
00:03:30.068 --> 00:03:33.732
Where: Okie Dokie Corral

58
00:03:33.733 --> 00:03:36.093
Warning to Sheriff Roscoe:

59
00:03:36.094 --> 00:03:39.010
You and your deputy had better show up to fight.

60
00:03:39.011 --> 00:03:47.914
Or we'll keep causing trouble around town!

